ader"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__base Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__size-medium Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__pictogram" aria-hidden="true"></div><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__heading text-headline-4-serif Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__balance Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__planName">Pro</h3><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__planBody text-body-3">Claude Code is included in your Pro plan. Perfect for short coding sprints in small codebases.</p></div><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__cardFooter"><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__priceWrap"><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__price text-body-large-1" data-plan="pro_annual" data-plan-field="amount_per_month">$17</div><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__priceNote text-caption">Per month with annual subscription discount (<span data-plan="pro_annual">$200</span> billed up front). <span data-plan="pro_monthly">$20</span> if billed monthly.</p></div><a href="https://claude.ai/login?plan=pro" class="Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__button Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__variant-primary Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__size-large text-body-2 Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="pricing-pro" data-cta-url="https://claude.ai/login?plan=pro">Try Claude<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></div></div><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__card" style="--card-index:1"><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__cardHeader"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__base Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__size-medium Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__pictogram" aria-hidden="true"></div><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__heading text-headline-4-serif Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__balance Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__planName">Max 5x</h3><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__planBody text-body-3">Claude Code is included in your Max plan. Great value for everyday use in larger codebases.</p></div><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__cardFooter"><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__priceWrap"><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__price text-body-large-1" data-plan="max_5x_monthly">$100</div><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__priceNote text-caption">Per month</p></div><a href="https://claude.ai/login?plan=max" class="Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__button Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__variant-primary Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__size-large text-body-2 Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="pricing-max-5x" data-cta-url="https://claude.ai/login?plan=max">Try Claude<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></div></div><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__card" style="--card-index:2"><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__cardHeader"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__base Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__size-medium Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__pictogram" aria-hidden="true"></div><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__heading text-headline-4-serif Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__balance Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__planName">Max 20x</h3><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__planBody text-body-3">Even more Claude Code included in your Max plan. Great value for power users with the most access to Claude models.</p></div><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__cardFooter"><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__priceWrap"><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__price text-body-large-1" data-plan="max_20x_monthly">$200</div><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__priceNote text-caption">Per month</p></div><a href="https://claude.ai/login?plan=max" class="Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__button Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__variant-primary Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__size-large text-body-2 Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="pricing-max-20x" data-cta-url="https://claude.ai/login?plan=max">Try Claude<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></div></div></div><div class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__disclaimerGroup"><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__disclaimer text-caption" data-tax-included-note="true" style="display:none"></p><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__disclaimer text-caption" data-adaptive-pricing-callout="true" style="display:none"></p><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__disclaimer text-caption" data-disclaimer-tax-exclusive="true"><a href="https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/9797557-usage-limit-best-practices" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="pricing-disclaimer" data-cta-url="https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/9797557-usage-limit-best-practices">Usage limits apply</a>. Prices shown don&#x27;t include applicable tax. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic&#x27;s discretion.</p><p class="Pricing-module-scss-module__GLAe0a__disclaimer text-caption" data-disclaimer-tax-inclusive="true" style="display:none"><a href="https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/9797557-usage-limit-best-practices" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="pricing-disclaimer" data-cta-url="https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/9797557-usage-limit-best-practices">Usage limits apply</a>. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic&#x27;s discretion.</p></div></div></section><div style="display:none" aria-hidden="true"></div><section id="changelog" data-section="changelog" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__C2Ksua__wrapper theme-main SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__C2Ksua__spacingTopNone"><div class="container"><div class="Changelog-module-scss-module__qvoCUq__root"><div class="Changelog-module-scss-module__qvoCUq__header"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__base Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__aI5yga__size-medium" aria-hidden="true"></div><h2 class="Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__heading text-headline-5-serif Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__balance Changelog-module-scss-module__qvoCUq__headline">Latest feature announcements<!-- --></h2></div><div class="Changelog-module-scss-module__qvoCUq__list"><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__O7RNzW__container Changelog-module-scss-module__qvoCUq__items Changelog-module-scss-module__qvoCUq__vertical" style="--reveal-y:20px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><div style="--reveal-index:0"><a href="https://claude.com/blog/introducing-dynamic-workflows-in-claude-code" class="CardLink-module-scss-module__nIezoW__card CardLink-module-scss-module__nIezoW__ghost Changelog-module-scss-module__qvoCUq__gridCard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="changelog" data-cta-url="https://claude.com/blog/introducing-dynamic-workflows-in-claude-code"><h3 class="CardLink-module-scss-module__nIezoW__title text-body-2-serif"><strong>Dynamic workflows:</strong> Tackle the most challenging tasks by executing across 10s to 100s of parallel subagents, and checking its work before anything reaches you.<!-- --></h3><span class="CardLink-module-scss-module__nIezoW__linkLabel text-caption"><div class="flex items-center justify-center CardLink-module-scss-module__nIezoW__icon" style="width:20px;height:20px"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="shrink-0 CardLink-module-scss-module__nIezoW__icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.59608 7.99088C9.019