-scss-module__79UnCq__contentColumn"><blockquote class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__quote"><p class="text-body-1">“<!-- -->Claude Code has dramatically accelerated our team&#x27;s coding efficiency. I can now write EDA code in a notebook—pulling data, training a model, and evaluating it with basic metrics—and then ask Claude to convert that into a Metaflow pipeline. This process saves 1-2 days of routine (and often boring!) work per model.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><p class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__caption text-caption">Anton Biryukov, Staff Software Engineer</p><a href="/customers/ramp" class="Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__button Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__size-small text-caption TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__storyLink" data-cta-position="testimonials-ramp" data-cta-url="/customers/ramp">Read story</a></div></div></li><li class="Testimonials-module-scss-module__binVBa__listItem"><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__card TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__horizontal"><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__logoColumn"><picture class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__logo"><source srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/ed84e4a853d81ea1796a0a4f0747c3ef0c8f2a50-141x23.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/fa755cc324f3ead28cea084cb63c403edfccc0da-141x23.svg" alt="Intercom" class="Logo-module-scss-module__WopJ-q__logo" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__contentColumn"><blockquote class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__quote"><p class="text-body-1">“<!-- -->With Claude, we&#x27;re not just automating customer service—we&#x27;re elevating it to truly human quality. This lets support teams think more strategically about customer experience and what makes interactions genuinely valuable.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><p class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__caption text-caption">Fergal Reid, VP of AI</p><a href="/customers/intercom" class="Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__button Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__size-small text-caption TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__storyLink" data-cta-position="testimonials-intercom" data-cta-url="/customers/intercom">Read story</a></div></div></li><li class="Testimonials-module-scss-module__binVBa__listItem"><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__card TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__horizontal"><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__logoColumn"><picture class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__logo"><source srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/dd3008e1cfe54ed4c627092ef30b3e6bd6088b0f-128x36.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/dd2c022495a4655e77541d16bc01b96e2052d6a3-128x36.svg" alt="Notion" class="Logo-module-scss-module__WopJ-q__logo" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__contentColumn"><blockquote class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__quote"><p class="text-body-1">“<!-- -->Claude Code is moving our team up a level: we decide what needs to happen, and smooth the process so it can build and verify end-to-end. A big part of my job now is to keep as many instances of Claude Code busy as possible.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><p class="TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__caption text-caption">Simon Last, Co-founder</p><a href="/customers/notion" class="Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__button Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__3m297q__size-small text-caption TestimonialCard-module-scss-module__79UnCq__storyLink" data-cta-position="testimonials-notion" data-cta-url="/customers/notion">Read story</a></div></div></li></ul></div></section><div style="display:none" aria-hidden="true"></div><section id="logoWall" data-section="logoWall" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__C2Ksua__wrapper theme-main SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__C2Ksua__spacingTopNone"><div class="container"><div class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__split"><div class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__splitCard"><ul class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__grid"><li class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__item"><div class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__target"><picture class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__logo"><source srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/63476247a79635d8f15e583b6b4e3d5acd8e93a8-111x26.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/84694a8c9a86c0b8bf37a874c675ccaeec9c6654-111x26.svg" alt="GitLab" class="Logo-module-scss-module__WopJ-q__logo" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></li><li class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__item"><div class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__target"><picture class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__logo"><source srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/60de8c5790f671fa333523ef031135f20450a6cd-181x32.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/05e7af628f73b9ab5ce68b47e2035d292564c421-181x32.svg" alt="Dynatrace" class="Logo-module-scss-module__WopJ-q__logo" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></li><li class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__item"><div class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__target"><picture class="LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__logo"><source srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/f36e4866832a87ab3609e517ce7a13bfa1e92595-178x47.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/74ea6c22373a93746176788b31b17ea20ae59223-178x47.svg" alt="