VnbfmZB\":\"Get the technical rundown\",\"08jKoUyLW0\":\"Get it on Google Play\",\"0CvG3qb6C2\":\"Claude Code excels at both routine development tasks like bug fixes and testing, as well as transformative work like refactors and feature implementation that require deep codebase understanding.\",\"0FTRLd4IAK\":\"Claude Code is included in your Pro plan. Perfect for short coding sprints in small codebases.\",\"0W5YgjOd8C\":\"Flexible pooled usage\",\"0jJMjm+jPA\":\"Or read the \u003ca\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e\",\"1+SSQhm4bf\":\"\u003cb\u003eRoutines:\u003c/b\u003e Configure a routine once, and it can run on a schedule, from an API call, or in response to an event.\",\"1ATgHQhgyL\":\"Includes Claude Code and Claude Cowork\",\"1rMFg0JQMQ\":\"Audit logs\",\"1wokJ79qDV\":\"Download on the App Store\",\"1yI27UHVWQ\":\"Get the developer newsletter\",\"2WJFp1YqEN\":\"Start in your terminal\",\"2b6AZVea7M\":\"Anton Biryukov, Staff Software Engineer\",\"3I6tohOmT8\":\"Thank you! You're subscribed.\",\"4FnSLGY/jL\":\"Per seat / month. For teams of 2 to 150.\",\"4OTeOUc7PT\":\"Yes. Cla"])</script><script nonce="TPnKHw9RL72O59Ps7MhQvA==">self.__next_f.push([1,"ude Code runs locally in your terminal and talks directly to model APIs without requiring a backend server or remote code index. It also asks for permission before making changes to your files or running commands.\",\"4lOuLo24hP\":\"Early access to advanced Claude features\",\"5MDGuMLnEB\":\"Enter your email\",\"5a1X5/f0GE\":\"Team \u0026 Enterprise\",\"7GnV3M0ilx\":\"Code onboarding\",\"7NrmWSpPNp\":\"Everything in {previousPlan}, plus:\",\"7zyAzJqQJJ\":\"Sorry, there was a problem with your submission. Please try again later.\",\"9XGMrOTnKT\":\"How much does it cost to use?\",\"9l3FHo1rqB\":\"Claude Code is included with Team plan standard and premium seats. Includes self-serve seat management and usage credits at standard API rates.\",\"A61C8w9a82\":\"What should I use Claude for?\",\"AFiVmp/jhu\":\"Kick off coding tasks in Slack\",\"AsGe/hq5rk\":\"Connect Microsoft 365, @Claude, and more\",\"Auznb9aRrh\":\"Fergal Reid, VP of AI\",\"B1kbGgSfbf\":\"Download for Windows\",\"BB6lTqQOLY\":\"Explore plans\",\"BDUp/0Lp01\":\"Create files and execute code\",\"Bil1ISGOy5\":\"Your terminal is where real work happens. Claude Code connects with the tools that power development—deployment, databases, monitoring, version control. Rather than adding another interface to juggle, it enhances your existing stack.\",\"BwZb5mni5x\":\"Get Claude Code\",\"CDLJ0Wjq0x\":\"Enterprise\",\"CNfG9Dq1Zt\":\"From $100\",\"CQJzKN8cVI\":\"Claude Code works on macOS, Linux, and Windows. See full system requirements.\",\"D/ZD6IAZgu\":\"Seat price + usage\",\"D7vmeSqorj\":\"Memory across conversations\",\"DbJPLzWI00\":\"For everyday productivity\",\"DfAnn9VZIX\":\"HIPAA-ready offering available\",\"FEmwkli1hU\":\"Generate code and visualize data\",\"FF8JcX97n6\":\"$$17\",\"FJ6r9Eufij\":\"Continue with Google\",\"FOwbsXm6VV\":\"Pay as you go with standard Claude API pricing. Deploy to unlimited developers with no per-seat fee or platform charges.\",\"Fg6Vy9QMJG\":\"$$0\",\"GMGlL/Lcsj\":\"\u003cb\u003eDynamic workflows:\u003c/b\u003e Tackle the most challenging tasks by executing across 10s to 100s of parallel subagents, and checking its work before anything reaches you.\",\"GP4bLAJKf8\":\"Predictable usage per seat\",\"GWoVQxhRVj\":\"Common workflows\",\"GagvZM9roV\":\"Higher output limits for all tasks\",\"GfJ5cvf3CF\":\"Even more Claude Code included in your Max plan. Great value for power users with the most access to Claude models.\",\"HF143K5NAr\":\"Claude is an artificial intelligence, trained by Anthropic using Constitutional AI to be safe, accurate, and secure — the trusted assistant for you to do your best work.\",\"HMbjivrCNV\":\"Is Claude Code secure?\",\"HU+0CefWLk\":\"Super powerful terminal integration. Works with all your CLI tools alongside any IDE.\",\"Hfxoyy1aNF\":\"Choose 5x or 20x more usage than Pro*\",\"IgB6GUj3uH\":\"Individual\",\"Iv62ZyIGmq\":\"Claude Code's understanding of your codebase and dependencies enables it to make powerful, multi-file edits that work.\",\"JD3LFRaiXU\":\"Write, edit, and create content\",\"JLNwuE4tOW\":\"*\u003ca\u003eUsage limits apply.\u003c/a\u003e Prices and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"JWmizX/FBI\":\"What is fast mode on Claude Code?\",\"KorkNqY43b\":\"Fix software bugs faster with Claude\",\"KvrB2MkS1H\":\"Meet Claude\",\"LNXJWdoIN6\":\"Create what's exciting. Maintain what's essential.\",\"LRVkLV7Hgr\":\"Chat on web, iOS, Android, and on your desktop\",\"Lk6Bj3rToS\":\"\u003cstandard\u003e$20\u003c/standard\u003e/seat. Usage cost scales with model and task.\",\"LteDgy93R9\":\"What are the system requirements to run Claude Code?\",\"MRWcodfpX1\":\"5–20x more usage than Pro\",\"ND3DzPJ5JP\":\"No model training on your content by default\",\"NPPnZiceNd\":\"Unlock more from Claude with desktop extensions\",\"NnoyhwhldS\":\"\u003cb\u003eComputer use:\u003c/b\u003e Claude now opens your apps, navigates your browser, and runs your dev tools to complete tasks.\",\"O+QGhrX2LT\":\"or\",\"O0tRsUvDJG\":\"With Claude, we're not just automating customer service—we're elevating it to truly human quality. This lets support teams think more strategically about customer experience and what makes interactions genuinely valuable.\",\"OatF5mAvNM\":\"What kinds of tasks can Claude Code handle?\",\"Oenbazr9Jm\":\"Draft and iterate on websites, graphics, documents, and code alongside your "])</script><script nonce="TPnKHw9RL72O59Ps7MhQvA==">self.__next_f.push([1,"chat with Artifacts.\",\"P6GgnebqRh\":\"Priority access at high traffic times\",\"QApUINIDYB\":\"Meets you where you code\",\"Qpr1Da1f7N\":\"Ability to use more Claude models\",\"QrG/q/0nwX\":\"You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro or Max plan, a Team or Enterprise plan premium seat, or a Claude Console account. \u003ca\u003eDownload Claude Code\u003c/a\u003e and sign in with your respective Claude or Console credentials.\",\"R/eOkjWqNU\":\"Pro\",\"RMOn5LTG7Q\":\"Claude Code runs in your terminal and works alongside your preferred IDE and development tools without requiring you to change your workflow. Claude Code can also use command line tools (like Git) and MCP servers (like GitHub) to extend its own capabilities using your tools.\",\"ROBSvgY5lo\":\"When used with a Claude Console account, Claude Code consumes API tokens at \u003ca\u003estandard API pricing\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"RRp63dkeIU\":\"What is Claude and how does it work?\",\"SDGVBWkOFy\":\"Includes Claude Science\",\"SKSbwWen/3\":\"Includes Claude Cowork\",\"SZaT2AdIUl\":\"What developers are saying\",\"SnnOMA2wlW\":\"Fast mode is a high-speed configuration for Opus 5, making the model 2.5x faster at a higher cost per token. Fast mode is available: In research preview on Claude Code, and is priced at $10/$50 per million tokens. On consumption-based plans. Via usage credits for users on subscription plans.\",\"TFqOUdkTad\":\"Claude Code documentation\",\"TGDx1ikPDJ\":\"More usage*\",\"TI79WvQ5kU\":\"Single sign-on (SSO)\",\"TkDcZajDzk\":\"Latest feature announcements\",\"Txltt+43Pa\":\"Claude has five pricing plans available — Free, Pro, Max, Team, and Enterprise. The Free plan offers limited use with no payment required. \u003ca\u003eLearn more about available pricing plans\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"TyE4PlkMfX\":\"Via usage credits for users on subscription plans.\",\"TyVItC3Apb\":\"Integrate any context or tool through connectors with remote MCP\",\"TzE6GnXLOB\":\"How much does Claude Code cost?\",\"V3DZSAgwS0\":\"No commitment · Cancel anytime\",\"VHD4aUZXCE\":\"System for Cross-domain Identity Management (SCIM)\",\"Vn/B4Q2FzQ\":\"By continuing, you acknowledge Anthropic's \u003ca\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e and agree to get occasional promotional emails and notifications.\",\"VvjKJpgcvg\":\"Access to Research\",\"W8nHSdskn0\":\"FAQ\",\"WAMokYC7m5\":\"Mix and match seat types\",\"WGjpyApkxf\":\"Role-based access with fine grained permissioning\",\"X6AvQomsP7\":\"Enterprise deployment for the Claude desktop app\",\"X6cK197KO5\":\"Claude for Microsoft 365\",\"YKGWJSxqMY\":\"Read story\",\"YLao9+QH8h\":\"Please provide your email address if you'd like to receive our monthly developer newsletter. You can unsubscribe at any time.\",\"YYot3EpUou\":\"$$20\",\"YuZ2EYYkhH\":\"How do I get started with Claude?\",\"ZRan5/6oUK\":\"Connect Slack and Google Workspace services\",\"Zz6QTaW0y5\":\"Available for macOS, Linux, and Windows.\",\"aF7o2f3nQS\":\"Turn issues into PRs\",\"aT/oh4Nxvz\":\"Per standard seat per month (annual). Premium seats from \u003cpremium\u003e$100\u003c/premium\u003e/mo.\",\"azQRa7pYOp\":\"View changelog\",\"bELf2s68U0\":\"Download for Linux\",\"bL/ieQDt4B\":\"How Anthropic teams use Claude Code\",\"cD9MYY3JiA\":\"\u003cb\u003eAgent view:\u003c/b\u003e One place to manage all your Claude Code sessions.\",\"cHXyPLuQFl\":\"Introduction to agentic coding\",\"ca6VLXmR5d\":\"Stop bouncing between tools. Claude Code integrates with GitHub, GitLab, and your command line tools to handle the entire workflow—reading issues, writing code, running tests, and submitting PRs—all from your terminal.\",\"dG9CoZc8NU\":\"IP allowlisting\",\"dl29r7OlXE\":\"Ability to search the web\",\"epieNNdeXY\":\"Claude Code is moving our team up a level: we decide what needs to happen, and smooth the process so it can build and verify end-to-end. A big part of my job now is to keep as many instances of Claude Code busy as possible.\",\"f2/v2gQHjo\":\"Fast mode is a high-speed configuration for Opus 5, making the model 2.5x faster at a higher cost per token. Fast mode is available:\",\"fGpRdLrMdV\":\"Does Claude Code work with the Claude desktop app?\",\"fJ79V5uNwz\":\"Yes. Max, Pro, Team, and Enterprise users can access Claude Code on the Claude desktop app.\",\"fpD9g5c0+g\":\"Work with Claude directly in your codebase. Build, debug, and ship from your terminal, IDE, Slack, web, a"])</script><script nonce="TPnKHw9RL72O59Ps7MhQvA==">self.__next_f.push([1,"nd more.\",\"fubYuebYh9\":\"Access anywhere\",\"gVc7XkWaqo\":\"Quick access from browser, mobile app, or Claude on desktop. Great for parallel work or on-the-go coding.\",\"gczcC5Leue\":\"Subscribe\",\"gym0t97hr3\":\"Yes. Max, Pro, Team, and Enterprise users can access Claude Code on the \u003ca\u003eClaude desktop app\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"h1KcNqCY5k\":\"*\u003ca\u003eUsage limits apply.\u003c/a\u003e Prices shown don't include applicable tax. Prices and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"h1ZCL0rm+U\":\"Using CLAUDE.md files\",\"h9g1IEUMWL\":\"Make powerful edits\",\"hJZwTSF8Wx\":\"Email address\",\"hcoACxj9cD\":\"Enterprise plan includes everything in the Team plan, plus advanced security, data, and user management. \u003ca\u003eLearn more here\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"hpjBFT7MBG\":\"Claude Code is included in your Max plan. Great value for everyday use in larger codebases.\",\"hvATMfbD6N\":\"Get started with Claude Code\",\"hvD2/48aAq\":\"Admins set user and org spend limits\",\"hy0YlmzQtV\":\"Share your best chats with your team to spark better ideas and move work forward on the Claude Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"iQYFHFpp2/\":\"Start building\",\"iZmBMJrb0b\":\"Create Projects and add knowledge so that you can deliver expert-level results with the Claude Pro, Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"ii5+AISEyS\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits apply\u003c/a\u003e. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"ilGFW+DK9E\":\"What could you do with Claude Code?\",\"jcwE2sEK9f\":\"Connects with your favorite command line tools\",\"jw+K5d+CdN\":\"When used with a Claude Console account, Claude Code consumes API tokens at standard API pricing.\",\"k4+9FsLhU8\":\"On consumption-based plans.\",\"kMJ7N+HH1m\":\"Includes Claude Design\",\"kkjl2vQekD\":\"Max\",\"l6yCDglZqT\":\"Continue with email\",\"lVREK+O2A7\":\"Claude Security (beta)\",\"lcjzsP/DJa\":\"Per month with annual subscription discount (\u003cannual\u003e$200\u003c/annual\u003e billed up front). \u003cmonthly\u003e$20\u003c/monthly\u003e if billed monthly.\",\"lpFUMU324g\":\"Compliance API for observability and monitoring\",\"m0TzBiIhvZ\":\"Central billing and administration\",\"m7v1ahj/te\":\"Native extensions for VS Code (+ Cursor, Devin Desktop) and JetBrains IDEs.\",\"mENE7vJhVQ\":\"Extended thinking for complex work\",\"mofX8KnW9/\":\"Claude Code works on macOS, Linux, and Windows. \u003ca\u003eSee full system requirements\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"oJiyzDUmhQ\":\"Claude Code has dramatically accelerated our team's coding efficiency. I can now write EDA code in a notebook—pulling data, training a model, and evaluating it with basic metrics—and then ask Claude to convert that into a Metaflow pipeline. This process saves 1-2 days of routine (and often boring!) work per model.\",\"omjuNlvXVf\":\"Think fast,{br}build faster\",\"pCyFJadqy/\":\"Simon Last, Co-founder\",\"pZ4CtGSlwT\":\"Try Claude\",\"pwc0DlEZo3\":\"You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro or Max plan, a Team or Enterprise plan premium seat, or a Claude Console account. Download Claude Code and sign in with your respective Claude or Console credentials.\",\"qSEmqaxK/a\":\"Download desktop app\",\"qank7+0V6w\":\"Continue with SSO\",\"qavaSjp85p\":\"Includes Claude Code\",\"qhHpS4CiBR\":\"Get Enterprise plan\",\"rsNxxABBT7\":\"Read documentation\",\"ruo+K7xIaj\":\"Admin controls for remote and local connectors\",\"s4tKRBaNlH\":\"Access to unlimited projects to organize chats and documents\",\"s8DKo7UP+l\":\"Share and collaborate with your team\",\"seQIayZV8Q\":\"Claude is a next generation AI assistant built by Anthropic and trained to be safe, accurate, and secure to help you do your best work.\",\"st9QnC8LFC\":\"Create with Claude\",\"tarJilR3bR\":\"How does Claude Code work with my existing tools?\",\"tf1lIh/bri\":\"Free\",\"tnjl+le6id\":\"In resea