{\"name\":\"GitHub\",\"logo\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/7522fc92399dcb4a68f11c7e147e711fcadbe75b-126x36.svg\",\"logoDark\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/c07e39d9053c9eb71e2fd92a503aa14206036e08-126x36.svg\"},{\"name\":\"Vercel\",\"logo\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/dfe2bb49cbe6a11d747deb00e01474b0ac4a8de8-120x24.svg\",\"logoDark\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/3a9531979d18b698a65633ba8768aedc7e16d5e7-120x24.svg\"},{\"name\":\"New Relic\",\"logo\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/381cea7f0fc11a867d2e8fa86028a1bc87fd9aad-142x28.svg\",\"logoDark\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/claude-com/dc0512750af90c283790aff69b7ddd8567f0f340-142x28.svg\"}],\"rows\":2,\"cols\":2}]}],\"$L70\"]}]}]]}]}]\n38:\"Latest feature announcements\"\n3b:[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"chi"])</script><script nonce="TPnKHw9RL72O59Ps7MhQvA==">self.__next_f.push([1,"ldren\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\".0\",{\"children\":[\"Dynamic workflows:\"]}]}],\" Tackle the most challenging tasks by executing across 10s to 100s of parallel subagents, and checking its work before anything reaches you.\"]\n3c:[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\".0\",{\"children\":[\"Agent view:\"]}]}],\" One place to manage all your Claude Code sessions.\"]\n3d:[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\".0\",{\"children\":[\"Routines:\"]}]}],\" Configure a routine once, and it can run on a schedule, from an API call, or in response to an event.\"]\n3e:[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\".0\",{\"children\":[\"Computer use:\"]}]}],\" Claude now opens your apps, navigates your browser, and runs your dev tools to complete tasks.\"]\n3f:\"View changelog\"\n44:\"Meets you where you code\"\n45:\"Start in your terminal\"\n46:\"Super powerful terminal integration. Works with all your CLI tools alongside any IDE.\"\n48:[\"Or read the \",[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",\".1\",{\"href\":\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/overview\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noreferrer\",\"data-cta-position\":\"mediaRow-terminal\",\"data-cta-url\":\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/overview\",\"children\":[\"documentation\"]}]}]]\n49:\"Integrate with your editor\"\n4a:\"Native extensions for VS Code (+ Cursor, Devin Desktop) and JetBrains IDEs.\"\n52:\"Get the technical rundown\"\n53:\"Claude Code documentation\"\n54:\"Common workflows\"\n55:\"Using CLAUDE.md files\"\n56:\"Introduction to agentic coding\"\n57:\"How Anthropic teams use Claude Code\"\n58:\"Fix software bugs faster with Claude\"\n5a:\"Work with Claude directly in your codebase. Build, debug, and ship from your terminal, IDE, Slack, web, and more.\"\n5c:\"Available for macOS, Linux, and Windows.\"\n5d:\"Other ways to use Claude Code:\"\n62:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__heading text-headline-5-serif Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__balance CtaBanner-module-scss-module__oOVh_a__headline\",\"children\":\"$L71\"}]\n63:[\"$\",\"$L4b\",null,{\"ctas\":[{\"_key\":\"Add to Slack\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"label\":\"Add to Slack\",\"linkType\":\"href\",\"href\":\"https://slack.com/oauth/v2/authorize?client_id=1601185624273.8899143856786\u0026scope=app_mentions:read,assistant:write,channels:history,channels:read,chat:write,files:read,files:write,groups:history,groups:read,im:history,im:read,im:write,mpim:history,reactions:write,users:read,users:read.email,commands,search:read.public\u0026user_scope=bookmarks:read,channels:history,channels:read,chat:write,emoji:read,files:read,groups:history,groups:read,groups:write,im:history,im:read,im:write,links:read,mpim:history,mpim:read,mpim:write,mpim:write.topic,pins:read,reactions:read,reactions:write,remote_files:read,team:read,users:read,users:read.email,search:read.public,search:read.private,search:read.im,search:read.mpim,search:read.files,search:read.users,canvases:read,canvases:write\",\"page\":null,\"openInNewTab\":true},{\"_key\":\"Learn more\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"label\":\"Learn more\",\"linkType\":\"href\",\"href\":\"/claude-for-slack\",\"page\":null,\"openInNewTab\":false}],\"variants\":[\"secondary\",\"tertiary\"],\"className\":\"CtaBanner-module-scss-module__oOVh_a__ctas\",\"ctaPosition\":\"ctaBanner\"}]\n6f:[false,\"$4f:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:children:0:1\",null]\n70:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__splitContent\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__heading text-headline-5-serif Heading-module-scss-module__RUqAea__balance LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__splitHeadline\",\"children\":\"$L72\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LogoWall-module-scss-module__JMoFRq__splitBody text-body-3\",\"children\":\"$L73\"}]]}]\n5f:\"Access anywhere\"\n60:\"Quick access from browser, mobile app, or Claude on desktop. Great for parallel work or on-the-go coding.\"\n64:\"What developers are saying\"\n66:\"Claude Code has dramatically accelerated our team's coding efficiency. I can now write EDA code in a notebook—pulling data, training a model, and evaluating it with basic metrics—and then ask Claude to convert that in"])</script><script nonce="TPnKHw9RL72O59Ps7MhQvA==">self.__next_f.push([1,"to a Metaflow pipeline. This process saves 1-2 days of routine (and often boring!) work per model.\"\n67:\"Anton Biryukov, Staff Software Engineer\"\n68:\"Read story\"\n6a:\"With Claude, we're not just automating customer service—we're elevating it to truly human quality. This lets support teams think more strategically about customer experience and what makes interactions genuinely valuable.\"\n6b:\"Fergal Reid, VP of AI\"\n6d:\"Claude Code is moving our team up a level: we decide what needs to happen, and smooth the process so it can build and verify end-to-end. A big part of my job now is to keep as many instances of Claude Code busy as possible.\"\n6e:\"Simon Last, Co-founder\"\n71:\"Kick off coding tasks in Slack\"\n72:\"Connects with your favorite command line tools\"\n73:\"Your terminal is where real work happens. Claude Code connects with the tools that power development—deployment, databases, monitoring, version control. Rather than adding another interface to juggle, it enhances your existing stack.\"\n"])</script></body></html>